# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository and the working tree on all
# platforms. Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` on Windows rewrites checked-out
# source files to CRLF, which breaks `forge fmt --check` locally and risks
# committing CRLF. git auto-detects binary files and leaves them untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Shell scripts are executed on Linux/CI — must stay LF regardless.
*.sh text eol=lf
